msgid "Limit Maximum Charge"
msgstr "Limiter la charge maximale"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:170
msgid "Stop Charging At"
msgstr "Arrêter la charge à"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:171 src/ui/power.rs:190 src/ui/preferences.rs:53
msgid "Percent"
msgstr "Pourcentage"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:175
msgid "Resume Charging Below"
msgstr "Reprendre la charge sous"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:176
msgid "Avoids topping up after every small drop"
msgstr "Évite de recharger après chaque petite baisse"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:180
msgid "Keep After Restart"
msgstr "Conserver après un redémarrage"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:181
msgid "Re-apply the limit at startup and after waking from sleep"
msgstr "Réapplique la limite au démarrage et à la sortie de veille"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:185
msgid "Apply"
msgstr "Appliquer"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:201
msgid "Charging Schedule"
msgstr "Programmation de la charge"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:202
msgid ""
"Charge to 100% just before you need the laptop, and keep your limit the rest "
"of the time. This needs a saved charge limit: turn on Limit Maximum Charge "
"and Keep After Restart, then Apply."
msgstr ""
"Chargez à 100% juste avant d’avoir besoin de l’ordinateur, et gardez votre "
"limite le reste du temps. Cela nécessite une limite de charge enregistrée : "
"activez « Limiter la charge maximale » et « Conserver après un "
"redémarrage », puis appuyez sur Appliquer."

#: src/ui/charging.rs:205
msgid "Optimized Charging"
msgstr "Charge optimisée"

#: src/ui/charging.rs:206
msgid "Learns when you usually unplug and charges to 100% just before"
