msgid ""
"Batteries lose capacity as they age. Maximum capacity compares how much "
"energy the battery holds now with how much it held when new."
msgstr ""
"Les batteries perdent de la capacité en vieillissant. La capacité maximale "
"compare l’énergie que la batterie retient maintenant à celle qu’elle "
"retenait à l’état neuf."

